  m_Name: Stevey
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalEntry
  entryTitle: Stevey
  entryDescription: You can run into two kinds of old people. Those that you can't
    stand to be around, and those who are sweet and comforting. He is neither of
    those. He is a strange, albeit somewhat funny, individual with a questionable
    past...my kinda guy.
